      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `decrypt_payload.py` that decrypts a ciphertext payload with a managed key, I will use the AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a managed key service and the need to make the provider identifiable in the code. The AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) will be used to interact with AWS KMS. </thinking>\n",
